# This directory stores pre-computed model files (.npy embedding arrays).
# These files are excluded from version control (see .gitignore).
#
# Required files (generated by running scripts 03 and 04):
#
#   album_embeddings.npy        — CLIP embeddings for album photos
#   album_names.npy             — Corresponding filenames
#   frames_embeddings.npy       — CLIP embeddings for representative frames
#   frames_names.npy            — Corresponding filenames
#   album_face_embeddings.npy   — InsightFace embeddings for album photos
#   album_face_names.npy        — Corresponding filenames
#   album_face_names.csv        — Bounding box + detection score metadata
#   frame_face_embeddings.npy   — InsightFace embeddings for frames
#   frame_face_names.npy        — Corresponding filenames
#   frame_face_names.csv        — Bounding box + detection score metadata
